{
  "bookId": "hero-214018",
  "id": "bond-29331",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29331001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "这次我们可以选择偏后期的阵容，担任核心的角色就选我的导师吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你的导师？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "在屏幕靠下的位置，「阿斯特莱雅」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "原来你指的就是这位最新的角色？胜负就指望她了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "有惊无险的胜利之后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "之前，你好像都没提起过导师呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "她是一个冷血到反而显得温情的人，我不太想提起她。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29331009",
              "text": "我懂我懂"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29331009",
              "text": "毕竟是师生关系……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29331008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "开始匹配下一局吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我发觉……虽然希塔帮我赢了很多局游戏，但我其实并不了解希塔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我的个人情报在资料网站上都有记录，或者你可以查我给你写的角色上分攻略——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那是「希塔」，不是希塔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我想了解正站在我面前的你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……这是什么意思?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "也就是说，我们可以多交流一些个人话题？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "个人……话题？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29331018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "比如，你在这里过得还愉快吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
